/add "8a325d3f-d3d9-5d3d-99eb-0e7c22af9373" :answer-field/id #uuid "8a325d3f-d3d9-5d3d-99eb-0e7c22af9373"] [:db/add "8a325d3f-d3d9-5d3d-99eb-0e7c22af9373" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "8a325d3f-d3d9-5d3d-99eb-0e7c22af9373" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "8a325d3f-d3d9-5d3d-99eb-0e7c22af9373" :answer-field/choices "1c40056d-167f-5fd6-a2c8-91a16502d9b6"] [:db/add "8a325d3f-d3d9-5d3d-99eb-0e7c22af9373" :answer-field/choices "e7e91bf3-cd87-52b9-b008-b64fdbb9cc96"] [:db/add "8a325d3f-d3d9-5d3d-99eb-0e7c22af9373" :answer-field/choices "e072f828-77a9-53b4-8ad7-05671e4b38a6"] [:db/add "8a325d3f-d3d9-5d3d-99eb-0e7c22af9373" :answer-field/choices "dce586af-e000-5e7a-a45a-d1259d407736"] [:db/add "8a325d3f-d3d9-5d3d-99eb-0e7c22af9373" :answer-field/choices "a1ae691c-d19b-599c-a30e-a61124bb2347"] [:db/add "8a325d3f-d3d9-5d3d-99eb-0e7c22af9373" :answer-field/correct "a1ae691c-d19b-599c-a30e-a61124bb2347"] [:db/ensure "8a325d3f-d3d9-5d3d-99eb-0e7c22af9373" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "b174a7be-b08b-5e25-a86d-19769c55edd0" :question/id #uuid "b174a7be-b08b-5e25-a86d-19769c55edd0"] [:db/add "b174a7be-b08b-5e25-a86d-19769c55edd0" :question/problem "Determine the graph of the following parametrically defined curve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x&=2 \\sqrt{t} - 1\\\\ y&=t - 4\\\\ &0\\le t\\le 4\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "b174a7be-b08b-5e25-a86d-19769c55edd0" :question/worked-solution "First calculate the $x$-values using $x=2 \\sqrt{t} - 1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ \\hline x & -1 & 1 & -1 + 2 \\sqrt{2} \\\\ \\hline y &  &  &  \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 3 & 4 \\\\ \\hline x & -1 + 2 \\sqrt{3} & 3 \\\\ \\hline y &  &  \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nNow calculate $y=t - 4$ at the **same parameter values**:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ \\hline x & -1 & 1 & -1 + 2 \\sqrt{2} \\\\ \\hline y & -4 & -3 & -2 \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 3 & 4 \\\\ \\hline x & -1 + 2 \\sqrt{3} & 3 \\\\ \\hline y & -1 & 0 \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nPair the coordinates at the same parameter value and follow the curve only over the stated interval.\n\n![Curve through the calculated points](images/64/644c4e11342a685abf340b562fc7b067b4b6f4fc600d44562d1e611059affe9d.png)"] [:db/add "b174a7be-b08b-5e25-a86d-19769c55edd0" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "b174a7be-b08b-5e25-a86d-19769c55edd0" :question/answer-fields "8a325d3f-d3d9-5d3d-99eb-0e7c22af9373"] [:db/ensure "b174a7be-b08b-5e25-a86d-19769c55edd0" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087721 :knowledge-point/questions "b174a7be-b08b-5e25-a86d-19769c55edd0"] [:db/add "c2d9d7a6-fd94-5d3f-bd73-ecac71c5545e" :answer/id #uuid "c2d9d7a6-fd94-5d3f-bd73-ecac71c5545e"] [:db/add "c2d9d7a6-fd94-5d3f-bd73-ecac71c5545e" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "c2d9d7a6-fd94-5d3f-bd73-ecac71c5545e" :answer/value "images/29/292e808e9d7fa05e5844d3716592dfcd4028a68755737736326166170acdcd99.png"] [:db/ensure "c2d9d7a6-fd94-5d3f-bd73-ecac71c5545e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "84e60af7-074d-5aaf-9895-d34daadb92fe" :answer/id #uuid "84e60af7-074d-5aaf-9895-d34daadb92fe"] [:db/add "84e60af7-074d-5aaf-9895-d34daadb92fe" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "84e60af7-074d-5aaf-9895-d34daadb92fe" :answer/value "images/2c/2cdb6885ff847d04d950fc85b2099dee37d3b71800df4c85d3bf9b71a78a4ca0.png"] [:db/ensure "84e60af7-074d-5aaf-9895-d34daadb92fe" :answer/validate] [:db/add "871479a8-06c8-5257-aa60-850daa7f2b38" :answer/id #uuid "871479a8-06c8-5257-aa60-850daa7f2b38"] [:db/add "871479a8-06c8-5257-aa60-850daa7f2b38" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "871479a8-06c8-5257-aa60-850daa7f2b38" :answer/value "images/9a/9a9c5750981a64fe78ebc9873ed5f801fd7649e0c1f9a25fcde9490957626b9e.png"] [:db/ensure "871479a8-06c8-5257-aa60-850daa7f2b38" :answer/validate] [:db/add "749249d6-e706-5405-8744-5f2d852