 defined curve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x&=t^{2} + 1\\\\ y&=t \\left(5 - t\\right) - 1\\\\ &0\\le t\\le 5\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "86f12a33-46be-5f58-8bcd-bcc31de26945" :question/worked-solution "First calculate the $x$-values using $x=t^{2} + 1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 0 & 1 & 2 & 3 & 4 \\\\ \\hline x & 1 & 2 & 5 & 10 & 17 \\\\ \\hline y &  &  &  &  &  \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 5 \\\\ \\hline x & 26 \\\\ \\hline y &  \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nNow calculate $y=t \\left(5 - t\\right) - 1$ at the **same parameter values**:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 0 & 1 & 2 & 3 & 4 \\\\ \\hline x & 1 & 2 & 5 & 10 & 17 \\\\ \\hline y & -1 & 3 & 5 & 5 & 3 \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 5 \\\\ \\hline x & 26 \\\\ \\hline y & -1 \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nPair the coordinates at the same parameter value and follow the curve only over the stated interval.\n\n![Curve through the calculated points](images/16/166261706759695bfe2b1e39e654b0bfc1de352cb2fd69f73b8be824e2a6dfdc.png)"] [:db/add "86f12a33-46be-5f58-8bcd-bcc31de26945" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "86f12a33-46be-5f58-8bcd-bcc31de26945" :question/answer-fields "af0eed1a-917e-57fa-8b80-5ae5f2977a49"] [:db/ensure "86f12a33-46be-5f58-8bcd-bcc31de26945" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087721 :knowledge-point/questions "86f12a33-46be-5f58-8bcd-bcc31de26945"] [:db/add "7247c935-1abc-5835-949e-30412e5bcd44" :answer/id #uuid "7247c935-1abc-5835-949e-30412e5bcd44"] [:db/add "7247c935-1abc-5835-949e-30412e5bcd44" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "7247c935-1abc-5835-949e-30412e5bcd44" :answer/value "images/27/27abab3a78e82bb61aae8e8312d0440789b0326df685bb894ed384f9bc82884f.png"] [:db/ensure "7247c935-1abc-5835-949e-30412e5bcd44" :answer/validate] [:db/add "72b0149a-de6c-5a19-b6b5-a31902c9eaef" :answer/id #uuid "72b0149a-de6c