|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 0 & 1 & 2 & 3 & 4 \\\\ \\hline x & -4 & -3 & 0 & 5 & 12 \\\\ \\hline y &  &  &  &  &  \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 5 \\\\ \\hline x & 21 \\\\ \\hline y &  \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nNow calculate $y=\\left(2 - t\\right) \\left(t + 3\\right) - 2$ at the **same parameter values**:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & -5 & -4 & -3 & -2 & -1 \\\\ \\hline x & 21 & 12 & 5 & 0 & -3 \\\\ \\hline y & -16 & -8 & -2 & 2 & 4 \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 0 & 1 & 2 & 3 & 4 \\\\ \\hline x & -4 & -3 & 0 & 5 & 12 \\\\ \\hline y & 4 & 2 & -2 & -8 & -16 \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & 5 \\\\ \\hline x & 21 \\\\ \\hline y & -26 \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nPair the coordinates at the same parameter value and follow the curve only over the stated interval.\n\n![Curve through the calculated points](images/2f/2fc7fa3f5f4d8e7396df639565653a1e029a452be9a11bc72321b66d7c07972a.png)"] [:db/add "e27c74e8-b40a-5c9b-9c5a-8f64a05f83f9" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "e27c74e8-b40a-5c9b-9c5a-8f64a05f83f9" :question/answer-fields "f9fb0c51-22ce-599a-917a-f8e3c0af0a46"] [:db/ensure "e27c74e8-b40a-5c9b-9c5a-8f64a05f83f9" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087721 :knowledge-point/questions "e27c74e8-b40a-5c9b-9c5a-8f64a05f83f9"] [:db/add "77d0b9f2-ea66-5dce-8c39-22ef6f20d3d9" :answer/id #uuid "77d0b9f2-ea66-5dce-8c39-22ef6f20d3d9"] [:db/add "77d0b9f2-ea66-5dce-8c39-22ef6f20d3d9" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "77d0b9f2-ea66-5dce-8c39-22ef6f20d3d9" :answer/value "images/9c/9c9471f17edc5c91cfdd96f10dc56b4c4d3ecd12125b959561c1e9e7e2195428.png"] [:db/ensure "77d0b9f2-ea66-5dce-8c39-22ef6f20d3d9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "92117a8f-49fb-594d-8a94-54924da4de9d" :answer/id #uuid "92117a8f-49fb-594d-8a94-54924da4de9d"] [:db/add "92117a8f-49fb-594d-8a94-54924da4de9d" 