lculate $y=t \\left(t + 2\\right) + t \\left(t^{2} - 4\\right) - 1$ at the **same parameter values**:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & -2 & -1 & 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ \\hline x & -7 & -8 & 1 & 8 & 1 \\\\ \\hline y & -1 & 1 & -1 & -1 & 7 \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nThe successive paired points are $(-7,-1)$, $(-8,1)$, $(1,-1)$, $(8,-1)$, $(1,7)$. Use the endpoint pair to find the matching group, then compare an interior paired point to distinguish the remaining curves.\n\n![Curve through the calculated points](images/10/10832227da98aefa8aba29212552a52f345bc99c66b76dbf15a49bce3ed40bec.png)"] [:db/add "d55cca76-de79-57f1-8227-271ebb3b8b3b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "d55cca76-de79-57f1-8227-271ebb3b8b3b" :question/answer-fields "4a883168-7fa2-59a0-b767-3a4a4f58a105"] [:db/ensure "d55cca76-de79-57f1-8227-271ebb3b8b3b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087721 :knowledge-point/questions "d55cca76-de79-57f1-8227-271ebb3b8b3b"] [:db/add "07326043-3268-5054-919d-5d8a63b207ef" :answer/id #uuid "07326043-3268-5054-919d-5d8a63b207ef"] [:db/add "07326043-3268-5054-919d-5d8a63b207ef" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "07326043-3268-5054-919d-5d8a63b207ef" :answer/value "images/91/911edb63676226745d0bffce523e509bed21166e30c3fbc1a5cbe905a965a2e0.png"] [:db/ensure "07326043-3268-5054-919d-5d8a63b207ef" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9d45d435-2cee-5e31-8839-ea6c8ea9a161" :answer/id #uuid "9d45d435-2cee-5e31-8839-ea6c8ea9a161"] [:db/add "9d45d435-2cee-5e31-8839-ea6c8ea9a161" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "9d45d435-2cee-5e31-8839-ea6c8ea9a161" :answer/value "images/b1/b11cb06948721c93322e78ac453516944016d4a512ffeb62f7ebb8c0c8e8bc7f.png"] [:db/ensure "9d45d435-2cee-5e31-8839-ea6c8ea9a161" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b5af27a2-c468-51fa-99d2-fd85d76cc089" :answer/id #uuid "b5af27a2-c468-51fa-99d2-fd85d76cc089"] [:db/add "b5af27a2-c468-51fa-99d2-fd85d76cc089" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "b5af27a2-c468