date] [:db/add "8d6ba475-3a07-5e1e-8eb0-27a6171a04ca" :question/id #uuid "8d6ba475-3a07-5e1e-8eb0-27a6171a04ca"] [:db/add "8d6ba475-3a07-5e1e-8eb0-27a6171a04ca" :question/problem "Determine the graph of the following parametrically defined curve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x&=- t \\left(t - 2\\right) - t \\left(t^{2} - 4\\right) + 1\\\\ y&=t \\left(t + 2\\right) + t \\left(t^{2} - 4\\right) - 4\\\\ &-2\\leq t\\leq 2\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "8d6ba475-3a07-5e1e-8eb0-27a6171a04ca" :question/worked-solution "First calculate the $x$-values using $x=- t \\left(t - 2\\right) - t \\left(t^{2} - 4\\right) + 1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & -2 & -1 & 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ \\hline x & -7 & -5 & 1 & 5 & 1 \\\\ \\hline y &  &  &  &  &  \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nNow calculate $y=t \\left(t + 2\\right) + t \\left(t^{2} - 4\\right) - 4$ at the **same parameter values**:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & -2 & -1 & 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ \\hline x & -7 & -5 & 1 & 5 & 1 \\\\ \\hline y & -4 & -2 & -4 & -4 & 4 \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nThe successive paired points are $(-7,-4)$, $(-5,-2)$, $(1,-4)$, $(5,-4)$, $(1,4)$. Use the endpoint pair to find the matching group, then compare an interior paired point to distinguish the remaining curves.\n\n![Curve through the calculated points](images/24/24b42b201325f804414e74e363a630b457e2277fface160388462c14ca94233e.png)"] [:db/add "8d6ba475-3a07-5e1e-8eb0-27a6171a04ca" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "8d6ba475-3a07-5e1e-8eb0-27a6171a04ca" :question/answer-fields "d3e49285-c157-5bcc-b058-c94b27b2cafd"] [:db/ensure "8d6ba475-3a07-5e1e-8eb0-27a6171a04ca" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087721 :knowledge-point/questions "8d6ba475-3a07-5e1e-8eb0-27a6171a04ca"] [:db/add "6476652f-77fe-56ff-ad04-9a3a7d48877d" :answer/id #uuid "6476652f-77fe-56ff-ad04-9a3a7d48877d"] [:db/add "6476652f-77fe-56ff-ad04-9a3a7d48877d" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "6476652f-77fe-5