q 2\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "39b5fa8d-81ac-5c2f-aa40-b70eb0367951" :question/worked-solution "First calculate the $x$-values using $x=t \\left(t - 2\\right) - t \\left(t^{2} - 4\\right) - 2$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & -2 & -1 & 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ \\hline x & 6 & -2 & -2 & 0 & -2 \\\\ \\hline y &  &  &  &  &  \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nNow calculate $y=t \\left(t + 2\\right) + t \\left(t^{2} - 4\\right) - 2$ at the **same parameter values**:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & -2 & -1 & 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ \\hline x & 6 & -2 & -2 & 0 & -2 \\\\ \\hline y & -2 & 0 & -2 & -2 & 6 \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nThe successive paired points are $(6,-2)$, $(-2,0)$, $(-2,-2)$, $(0,-2)$, $(-2,6)$. Use the endpoint pair to find the matching group, then compare an interior paired point to distinguish the remaining curves.\n\n![Curve through the calculated points](images/4c/4c29e50fb1670032585f4586d9e2bc35b8c5cddff1cfba3e5f141a2d05a0f6f9.png)"] [:db/add "39b5fa8d-81ac-5c2f-aa40-b70eb0367951" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "39b5fa8d-81ac-5c2f-aa40-b70eb0367951" :question/answer-fields "1820e948-d720-5255-a6bd-782bf61d193c"] [:db/ensure "39b5fa8d-81ac-5c2f-aa40-b70eb0367951" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087721 :knowledge-point/questions "39b5fa8d-81ac-5c2f-aa40-b70eb0367951"] [:db/add "fa965673-7920-5853-ae4f-798eef2c877b" :answer/id #uuid "fa965673-7920-5853-ae4f-798eef2c877b"] [:db/add "fa965673-7920-5853-ae4f-798eef2c877b" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "fa965673-7920-5853-ae4f-798eef2c877b" :answer/value "images/5f/5f1878b3cc86cb43a578c0a28e27b026a71fc3be90905457d357e8fba95d363e.png"] [:db/ensure "fa965673-7920-5853-ae4f-798eef2c877b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "dc5755a5-a94f-53fe-b282-e145d59d09b9" :answer/id #uuid "dc5755a5-a94f-53fe-b282-e145d59d09b9"] [:db/add "dc5755a5-a94f-53fe-b282-e145d59d09b9" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "dc5755a5-a94f-53fe-b282-e145d