 + 2$ at the **same parameter values**:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & -2 & -1 & 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ \\hline x & 8 & 6 & 0 & -4 & 0 \\\\ \\hline y & 2 & 4 & 2 & 2 & 10 \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nThe successive paired points are $(8,2)$, $(6,4)$, $(0,2)$, $(-4,2)$, $(0,10)$. All five choices share the endpoint pair and the middle checkpoint. Compare the interior paired points and the bends between them.\n\n![Curve through the calculated points](images/24/24a7f0b61160b3f79c95608965271f791347c3e5bb3482677782d79a1eba3d9a.png)"] [:db/add "02c58355-259d-5a1d-b5df-7d2288926e47" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "02c58355-259d-5a1d-b5df-7d2288926e47" :question/answer-fields "3a4dba83-a9f4-5875-ac8e-15b269643e53"] [:db/ensure "02c58355-259d-5a1d-b5df-7d2288926e47" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087721 :knowledge-point/questions "02c58355-259d-5a1d-b5df-7d2288926e47"] [:db/add "e67598bc-7f10-5f8b-b1f9-cdda60dc6800" :answer/id #uuid "e67598bc-7f10-5f8b-b1f9-cdda60dc6800"] [:db/add "e67598bc-7f10-5f8b-b1f9-cdda60dc6800" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "e67598bc-7f10-5f8b-b1f9-cdda60dc6800" :answer/value "images/a9/a98cafc7445d3524648e14bf7974057463342d684f90ec35bb3c017dc6dabe8e.png"] [:db/ensure "e67598bc-7f10-5f8b-b1f9-cdda60dc6800" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f5c7d84b-a5f9-5ac0-8b94-2bf696e584f9" :answer/id #uuid "f5c7d84b-a5f9-5ac0-8b94-2bf696e584f9"] [:db/add "f5c7d84b-a5f9-5ac0-8b94-2bf696e584f9" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "f5c7d84b-a5f9-5ac0-8b94-2bf696e584f9" :answer/value "images/80/800aefa0ebea324fc8d05eaf75c762929fe6e930db230002041d69e2e974b523.png"] [:db/ensure "f5c7d84b-a5f9-5ac0-8b94-2bf696e584f9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b33d346a-f7d3-5453-b5b6-2bccaec57a54" :answer/id #uuid "b33d346a-f7d3-5453-b5b6-2bccaec57a54"] [:db/add "b33d346a-f7d3-5453-b5b6-2bccaec57a54" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "b33d346a-f7d3-5453-b5b6-2bccaec57a54" :answer/value "images/07/07c069cfc50eb0e5