-877c-60a54ea128bd" :question/worked-solution "First calculate the $x$-values using $x=t \\left(t - 2\\right) + t \\left(t^{2} - 4\\right) - 1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & -2 & -1 & 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ \\hline x & 7 & 5 & -1 & -5 & -1 \\\\ \\hline y &  &  &  &  &  \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nNow calculate $y=t \\left(t + 2\\right) - t \\left(t^{2} - 4\\right)$ at the **same parameter values**:\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline \\mathbf{t} & -2 & -1 & 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ \\hline x & 7 & 5 & -1 & -5 & -1 \\\\ \\hline y & 0 & -4 & 0 & 6 & 8 \\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\n$$\n\nThe successive paired points are $(7,0)$, $(5,-4)$, $(-1,0)$, $(-5,6)$, $(-1,8)$. All five choices share the endpoint pair and the middle checkpoint. Compare the interior paired points and the bends between them.\n\n![Curve through the calculated points](images/8a/8a2c95cfa4a1020d398a58f2cf8287d5728f21478b923c0aa66a95053526b5bd.png)"] [:db/add "7a3fc91c-1e8e-5587-877c-60a54ea128bd" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "7a3fc91c-1e8e-5587-877c-60a54ea128bd" :question/answer-fields "3a1f45c1-826f-5533-b619-c6581da32a2c"] [:db/ensure "7a3fc91c-1e8e-5587-877c-60a54ea128bd" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087721 :knowledge-point/questions "7a3fc91c-1e8e-5587-877c-60a54ea128bd"] [:db/add "45256a2c-4f2b-564d-8280-1d4f3970a50a" :answer/id #uuid "45256a2c-4f2b-564d-8280-1d4f3970a50a"] [:db/add "45256a2c-4f2b-564d-8280-1d4f3970a50a" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "45256a2c-4f2b-564d-8280-1d4f3970a50a" :answer/value "images/ca/ca2905eba3bb2e0332914d613f0158c74b382bc2faf6bf472c6efea1fc612d65.png"] [:db/ensure "45256a2c-4f2b-564d-8280-1d4f3970a50a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d8ccc19e-a8b8-567e-906c-4051b90ebe81" :answer/id #uuid "d8ccc19e-a8b8-567e-906c-4051b90ebe81"] [:db/add "d8ccc19e-a8b8-567e-906c-4051b90ebe81" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "d8ccc19e-a8b8-567e-906c-4051b90ebe81" :answer/value "images/34/3477b6f3b647133ff86f0689